ADDITIONAL NOTICE — NOT INVESTMENT ADVICE

This repository documents a quantitative stock-rating methodology for
informational and educational purposes only. It is not investment advice, not
a recommendation to buy or sell any security, and not a solicitation.

Tapetide is not a SEBI-registered research analyst or investment adviser.
Scores produced by this methodology are decision-support summaries of
published data, not forecasts. Consult a qualified, registered advisor before
making investment decisions.

If you implement this methodology and publish scores derived from it, please
state that they are your own implementation and link back to this repository,
so readers can distinguish your calibration from ours.
